      "source": "Projecting variant of <a href=\"MappingRelationalConverter.ConversionContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>MappingRelationalConverter.ConversionContext</code></a> applying mapping-metadata rules from the related entity.",
