    {
      "source": "Extended <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/ParameterValueProvider.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ParameterValueProvider</code></a> that can report whether a property value is present and contextualize the\ninstance for specific behavior like projection mapping in the context of a property.",
