      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks whether we have a custom conversion for the given simple object. Converts the given value if so, applies\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Enum</code></a> handling or returns the value as is.",
