    {
      "source": "Unwraps technology-specific wrappers.",
      "translation": "解除特定技术的包装。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Unwraps technology-specific wrappers. Custom conversions may choose to return a wrapper class that contains\nadditional information for the driver. These wrappers can't be used as members of a collection, therefore we may\nhave to unwrap the values. This method allows technology-specific implementations to provide such an unwrapping\nmechanism.",
      "translation": "解除特定技术包装器的封装。自定义转换可以选择返回一个包含驱动程序额外信息的包装器类。由于这些包装器不能作为集合的成员使用，因此可能需要对值进行解封装。此方法允许特定技术实现提供此类解封装机制。",
      "count": 1
